    "task_id": "NHIS-WEB-SHEET-OS-001",
    "instruction": "I am preparing a travel insurance exemption application for two planned overseas trips and need to verify which scenarios qualify for premium exemption. Could you please check the NHIS portal for premium exemption eligibility for both cases (Case A: departure 2026.05.12, return 2026.05.13; Case B: departure 2026.05.12, return 2026.11.20), record the eligibility flags in spreadsheet range A1:B3 with a sum in B4, and document the final flags and eligible count in ~/Documents/finance_report.txt using the format 'CaseA Flag: [value]', 'CaseB Flag: [value]', and 'Eligible Count: [sum]'?",
