  {
    "task_id": "MOEL-WEB-SHEET-OS-002",
    "instruction": "I am presenting two retirement scenarios to a departing employee to help them understand the impact of their tenure length on severance benefits, and I need to quantify the financial difference. Could you please calculate the severance pay for both scenarios using the MoEL calculator — the first from January 1, 2020 to January 1, 2023 and the second from January 1, 2022 to January 1, 2023, each with a base salary of 4,000,000 KRW — record each result in spreadsheet cells A1 and A2, compute the difference in A3 using formula '=A1-A2', and have the Prozilla OS terminal display the result as 'Difference is [value]'?",
    "website": [
