    "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_nhis_03",
    "instruction": "Could you open NHIS foreign mandatory enrollment date simulation. Use stay type D-4 and first entry date 2026.05.29, then calculate the scheduled date. In Spreadsheet, fill A1:D2 with A1='체류자격', B1='입국일', C1='가입예정일', D1='일수차이', A2='D-4(일반연수)', and B2='2026.05.29', then record the calculated scheduled date in C2 and set D2 to '=C2-B2'. In Prozilla OS, create ~/Documents/finance_report.txt and write the results in the format 'Entry: [value]', 'Scheduled: [value]', 'Gap Days: [value]'.",
