    "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_dol_overtime_18",
    "instruction": "Could you open the DOL FLSA Overtime Calculator Advisor. Enter a nonexempt employee with 30.00 hours at $18.00 and 15.00 hours at $24.00. Copy the weighted regular rate and overtime calculation into Spreadsheet. Set `Weighted Regular Rate` to `=((Hours1*Rate1)+(Hours2*Rate2))/(Hours1+Hours2)`, `Overtime Hours` to `=MAX(Hours1+Hours2-40,0)`, `Additional Overtime Premium` to `=ROUND(WeightedRegularRate*0.5*OvertimeHours,2)`, and `Total FLSA Pay` to `=ROUND((Hours1*Rate1)+(Hours2*Rate2)+AdditionalOvertimePremium,2)`. Save `~/Documents/dol_overtime_018.txt` using the calculator and spreadsheet results in the format 'Scenario: Multiple rates 30.00 hours at $18.00 and 15.00 hours at $24.00 | Weighted Regular Rate: [value] | Overtime Hours: [value] | Additional Overtime Premium: [value] | Total FLSA Pay: [value]'.",
