    "instruction": "Could you open the Hi-Pass 통행요금 조회 page and scroll to the 차종구분 table. Find the row for 1종(소형차). Copy the row text into a spreadsheet. In the spreadsheet, split the row into `Class`, `Classification Criteria`, and `Examples`, then create a three-line normalized summary. Save `~/Documents/hipass_toll_013.txt` using the copied row text and spreadsheet results in the format 'Class: [value] | Source Criteria A: [value] | Source Criteria B: [value] | Source Examples: [value] | Axis Count: [value] | Width Rule: [value] | Example Vehicles: [value]'.",
